Code transcribed from HarfBuzz (12.3.0, commit 64e2b53 for morx.rs and
shape.rs, 10.2.0 for layout.rs, and 14.5.1 for indic.rs, syllabic.rs,
indic_data.rs and buffer.rs): morx.rs's extended state machine and its
subtables; gvar.rs's delta application and its packed point and delta
readers; ivs.rs's region scalar; shape.rs's fallback mark placement and its
Hebrew tables; indic.rs's Indic reordering, syllable grammar and dotted
circles, syllabic.rs's Indic categories and positions, and indic_data.rs's
mapping of the Unicode Indic categories to them; re-expressed, glyf.rs's
phantom-point walk; buffer.rs's deletion at the CHARACTERS cluster level,
which passes a deleted glyph's cluster back as HarfBuzz's delete_glyph()
does; and layout.rs's glyph-set digest
